            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "Thanks @55101. A good start. I have a few points: The proposed location for high-risk medicines seems too close to the fast-movers, which could increase picking errors. Also, we need to explicitly map out the temperature-sensitive items as per T11; they can't be on that top shelf under the lights. We should also consider the workflow from the counter – the most common items should be closest.",
            "mentions": [
