            "msg_id": "M22",
            "speaker_id": 255566,
            "reply_to": "M21",
            "text": "Agree with @84286. Also, from a customer perspective, having the baby care items next to the adult incontinence products might be a bit awkward. Maybe we can swap baby care with vitamins?",
