              "T11"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M24",
            "speaker_id": 84286,
            "reply_to": "M23",
            "text": "No problem, that's why we review. For high-risk, let's create a dedicated, clearly marked section behind the counter, away from the main picking run. For temp-sensitive, they need to stay in the designated fridge or the coolest part of the store. I can help you mark these on the map in A2.",
            "mentions": [],
